// A name of 4 letters or more that begins one of the AppServer's keywords
// is the keyword to it, wherever it is -- a method, a Data, a Local, a
// function --, and the line is refused ("C2003 Syntax Error"; LOCAL's,
// "C9907 Invalid use of reserved word LOCAL"; tried on 24.3.1.9). SEQUENCE,
// MEMVAR, FIELD and REQUEST are not read so; nor a name longer than the
// keyword (Returns), one that only shares its first letters (Statement), a
// User Function's (Decl).
Class Pedido
  Public Data Stat
  Public Data Memv
  Public Method New() Constructor
  Public Method Other()
EndClass

Method New() Class Pedido
  ::Stat := 0
  ::Memv := 0
Return Self

Method Other() Class Pedido
Return 1

Static Function Proc(Param)
  Local Loca := Param
  Local Sequ := 1
  Local Returns := 2
  Local Statement := 3
  Private Retu := 3
Return Loca + Sequ + Returns + Statement + Retu

User Function Decl()
Return Proc(1)
